title: "CarFinder 2026"
abstract: "A free, open source vehicle finder for 11 countries: every new car, motorcycle, boat and aircraft on sale with its list price, the price dealers really charge, and the on-road price for the buyer's state or city, with the source of every price, filters, comparison and running-cost estimates. One self-contained web page."
